---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---
<Layout route="konsultasi" title={'Simulasi Proteksi & Jadwal Konsultasi | Denny Indra'} description={'Hitung kebutuhan uang pertanggungan dan jadwalkan konsultasi privat bersama Denny Indra.'}>
<div class="flex flex-col w-full">
<!-- Top Executive Header Banner -->
<section class="relative w-full bg-inverse-surface text-inverse-on-surface overflow-hidden py-16 lg:py-24">
<div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 bg-[radial-gradient(#ffffff_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:20px_20px] pointer-events-none"></div>
<div class="absolute -right-24 -bottom-24 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-primary-container/20 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 relative z-10">
<div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-end justify-between gap-8">
<div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-sm bg-tertiary-container/30 text-tertiary-fixed text-label-sm font-label-sm tracking-wider uppercase backdrop-blur-md">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">verified</span>
            Private Wealth Advisory Suite
          </div>
<h1 class="font-display text-display leading-tight text-inverse-on-surface">
            Kalkulator Kebutuhan Proteksi &amp; Booking Sesi Perencanaan Portofolio
          </h1>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-secondary-fixed max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
            Hitung presisi uang pertanggungan, rancang dana warisan multi-generasi, dan jadwalkan dialog tatap muka eksklusif bersama Denny Indra, CFP® (Premier MDRT Prudential).
          </p>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-4 bg-surface-container-lowest/10 backdrop-blur-md p-4 rounded-xl">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary-container flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">shield_with_heart</span>
</div>
<div>
<div class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-inverse-on-surface leading-none">IDR 180M+</div>
<div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary-fixed mt-1">Total Portofolio Polis Dikelola</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="w-px h-10 bg-secondary-fixed/20 hidden sm:block"></div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-tertiary-fixed font-label-sm text-label-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">military_tech</span>
            Top 1% Financial Planner
          </div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Interactive Dual Workspace: Calculator & Appointment Scheduler -->
<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 -mt-8 relative z-20 w-full mb-20">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
<!-- LEFT: Wealth Protection Calculator -->
<div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-xl p-6 sm:p-10 space-y-8">
<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between pb-4 gap-2">
<div>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold">Simulasi Finansial 360°</span>
<h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface">Kalkulator Kebutuhan Proteksi &amp; Warisan</h2>
</div>
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-sm bg-surface-container text-secondary text-label-md font-label-md">
<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary animate-pulse"></span>
            Real-time Algoritma
          </span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-secondary">
          Tentukan parameter dasar keluarga Anda untuk mengukur proteksi pendapatan, kesiapan inflasi medis, serta transfer kekayaan bebas sengketa.
        </p>
<!-- Form Sliders and Selectors -->
<div class="space-y-6">
<!-- Monthly Expense -->
<div class="space-y-2">
<div class="flex justify-between items-center">
<label class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface font-semibold" for="expenseSlider">
                Pengeluaran Rutin Keluarga / Bulan
              </label>
<span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary font-bold" id="expenseValDisplay">
                Rp 35.000.000
              </span>
</div>
<input class="w-full h-2 bg-surface-container rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-primary-container" id="expenseSlider" max="200000000" min="10000000" step="5000000" type="range" value="35000000"/>
<div class="flex justify-between font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary">
<span>Rp 10 Jt</span>
<span>Rp 100 Jt</span>
<span>Rp 200 Jt+</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Dependent Children -->
<div class="space-y-2">
<label class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface font-semibold">
              Jumlah Tanggungan Anak &amp; Usia Kritis
            </label>
<div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-3" id="childSelectionGroup">
<button class="child-btn py-2.5 rounded-sm text-label-md font-label-md bg-surface-container text-secondary transition-all" data-val="0" type="button">0 Anak</button>
<button class="child-btn py-2.5 rounded-sm text-label-md font-label-md bg-surface-container text-secondary transition-all" data-val="1" type="button">1 Anak</button>
<button class="child-btn py-2.5 rounded-sm text-label-md font-label-md bg-primary-container text-on-primary shadow-xs" data-val="2" type="button">2 Anak</button>
<button class="child-btn py-2.5 rounded-sm text-label-md font-label-md bg-surface-container text-secondary transition-all" data-val="3" type="button">3+ Anak</button>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Legacy Goal -->
<div class="space-y-2">
<div class="flex justify-between items-center">
<label class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface font-semibold" for="legacySlider">
                Target Dana Warisan Bebas Pajak (Estate Asset)
              </label>
<span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-bold" id="legacyValDisplay">
                Rp 5.000.000.000
              </span>
</div>
<input class="w-full h-2 bg-surface-container rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-primary-container" id="legacySlider" max="30000000000" min="1000000000" step="1000000000" type="range" value="5000000000"/>
<div class="flex justify-between font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary">
<span>Rp 1 Miliar</span>
<span>Rp 15 Miliar</span>
<span>Rp 30 Miliar</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Dynamic Output Matrix Cards -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl p-6 space-y-6">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<div class="font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface font-semibold flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-xl">analytics</span>
              Rekomendasi Portofolio Ideal Anda
            </div>
<span class="text-label-sm font-label-sm text-secondary">Formula Capital Need Analysis 2025</span>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
<!-- Metric 1: UP Jiwa -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-4 rounded-lg shadow-xs space-y-1">
<div class="text-secondary font-label-sm text-label-sm">UP Jiwa &amp; Sakit Kritis</div>
<div class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary font-bold" id="resultUP">
                Rp 8.5 Miliar
              </div>
<div class="text-secondary font-body-sm text-body-sm">
                Proteksi income 10 th + warisan tunai.
              </div>
</div>
<!-- Metric 2: Plafon Rawat Inap -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-4 rounded-lg shadow-xs space-y-1">
<div class="text-secondary font-label-sm text-label-sm">Plafon Medis / Tahun</div>
<div class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-bold" id="resultPlafon">
                Rp 35 Miliar
              </div>
<div class="text-secondary font-body-sm text-body-sm">
                PRUPrime Healthcare Plus (On-Bill).
              </div>
</div>
<!-- Metric 3: Estimasi Alokasi Bulanan -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-4 rounded-lg shadow-xs space-y-1">
<div class="text-secondary font-label-sm text-label-sm">Alokasi Premi Sehat</div>
<div class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-tertiary-container font-bold" id="resultPremi">
                ~ Rp 3.5 Jt /bln
              </div>
<div class="text-secondary font-body-sm text-body-sm">
                Rasio ideal 8-10% dari arus kas.
              </div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Chart Visual (Mini Inline SVG Ratio Breakdown) -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-4 rounded-lg flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4">
<div class="w-24 h-24 shrink-0 relative flex items-center justify-center">
<svg class="w-full h-full transform -rotate-90" viewbox="0 0 36 36">
<!-- Background circle -->
<path class="text-surface-container" d="M18 2.0845 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 31.831 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 -31.831" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"></path>
<!-- Stroke 1 (Living Protection) -->
<path class="text-primary-container" d="M18 2.0845 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 31.831 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 -31.831" fill="none" id="svgStrokeIncome" stroke="currentColor" stroke-dasharray="60, 100" stroke-width="4"></path>
<!-- Stroke 2 (Legacy) -->
<path class="text-tertiary-fixed-dim" d="M18 2.0845 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 31.831 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 -31.831" fill="none" id="svgStrokeLegacy" stroke="currentColor" stroke-dasharray="25, 100" stroke-dashoffset="-60" stroke-width="4"></path>
</svg>
<span class="absolute font-headline-sm text-headline-sm font-bold text-on-surface">100%</span>
</div>
<div class="space-y-1.5 w-full">
<div class="text-label-md font-label-md text-on-surface font-semibold">Komposisi Alokasi Solusi Proteksi:</div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-body-sm font-body-sm text-secondary">
<span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-primary-container"></span> Income Replacement &amp; Medis</span>
<span class="font-semibold text-on-surface">65%</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-body-sm font-body-sm text-secondary">
<span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-tertiary-fixed-dim"></span> Pure Legacy Estate</span>
<span class="font-semibold text-on-surface">35%</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-surface text-secondary font-body-sm text-body-sm flex items-start gap-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mt-0.5">info</span>
<span>
            Angka perhitungan adalah simulasi indikatif berdasarkan rumus aktuarial proteksi pendapatan (Income Replacement Method). Polis final diterbitkan secara formal mengikuti hasil medical underwriting Prudential Life Assurance.
          </span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- RIGHT: Interactive Private Booking Form -->
<div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-xl p-6 sm:p-10 space-y-8">
<div>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold">Private Advisory Access</span>
<h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface">Jadwalkan Konsultasi Privat</h2>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-secondary mt-1">
            Diskusi confidential 45 menit tanpa komitmen bersama Denny Indra.
          </p>
</div>
<form class="space-y-6" id="consultationBookingForm" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); window.handleBookingSubmit();">
<!-- Mode Selection -->
<div class="space-y-2">
<label class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface font-semibold">Pilih Format Pertemuan</label>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-2.5" id="meetingModes">
<label class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low cursor-pointer transition-all hover:bg-surface-container">
<input checked="" class="w-4 h-4 accent-primary" name="meetingMode" type="radio" value="office"/>
<div class="flex-1">
<div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface font-semibold">Prudential Tower &amp; Mall Kota Kasablanka Lt. 15</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary">Lounge Executive Jakarta Selatan (Ruang Privat)</div>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low cursor-pointer transition-all hover:bg-surface-container">
<input class="w-4 h-4 accent-primary" name="meetingMode" type="radio" value="zoom"/>
<div class="flex-1">
<div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface font-semibold">Private Video Call (Zoom HD)</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary">Enkripsi aman end-to-end, presentasi layar interaktif</div>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low cursor-pointer transition-all hover:bg-surface-container">
<input class="w-4 h-4 accent-primary" name="meetingMode" type="radio" value="coffee"/>
<div class="flex-1">
<div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface font-semibold">Coffee Meeting (Jakarta &amp; Surabaya)</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary">Hotel lounge atau cafe bintang lima pilihan Anda</div>
</div>
</label>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Date and Slot Picker -->
<div class="space-y-3">
<label class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface font-semibold" for="bookingDateInput">Pilih Tanggal &amp; Sesi Waktu</label>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
<div>
<input class="w-full px-3 py-2.5 rounded-sm bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:outline-hidden focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/40" id="bookingDateInput" required="" type="date"/>
</div>
<div>
<select class="w-full px-3 py-2.5 rounded-sm bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:outline-hidden focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/40" id="bookingSlotSelect" required="">
<option value="pagi">Pagi (10:00 - 11:30 WIB)</option>
<option selected="" value="siang">Siang (13:30 - 15:00 WIB)</option>
<option value="sore">Sore (16:00 - 17:30 WIB)</option>
<option value="malam">Malam VIP (19:30 - 21:00 WIB)</option>
</select>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Risk & Interest Questionnaire -->
<div class="space-y-2">
<label class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface font-semibold">Topik Utama yang Ingin Didiskusikan</label>
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-label-md font-label-md">
<label class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2.5 rounded-sm bg-surface-container-low cursor-pointer">
<input checked="" class="w-4 h-4 rounded-sm accent-primary" name="focusTopic" type="checkbox" value="kesehatan"/>
<span class="text-on-surface text-body-sm font-body-sm">Kesehatan VIP Internasional</span>
</label>
<label class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2.5 rounded-sm bg-surface-container-low cursor-pointer">
<input checked="" class="w-4 h-4 rounded-sm accent-primary" name="focusTopic" type="checkbox" value="warisan"/>
<span class="text-on-surface text-body-sm font-body-sm">Dana Warisan &amp; Paper Asset</span>
</label>
<label class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2.5 rounded-sm bg-surface-container-low cursor-pointer">
<input class="w-4 h-4 rounded-sm accent-primary" name="focusTopic" type="checkbox" value="bisnis"/>
<span class="text-on-surface text-body-sm font-body-sm">Keyman Protection Korporat</span>
</label>
<label class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2.5 rounded-sm bg-surface-container-low cursor-pointer">
<input class="w-4 h-4 rounded-sm accent-primary" name="focusTopic" type="checkbox" value="edukasi"/>
<span class="text-on-surface text-body-sm font-body-sm">Dana Pendidikan Anak Luar Negeri</span>
</label>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Client Contact Details -->
<div class="space-y-3">
<div class="space-y-1">
<label class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface font-semibold" for="clientNameInput">Nama Lengkap Sesuai KTP</label>
<input class="w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-sm bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:outline-hidden focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/40" id="clientNameInput" placeholder="Contoh: Hendra Widjaja, S.E." required="" type="text"/>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
<div class="space-y-1">
<label class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface font-semibold" for="clientWhatsappInput">No. WhatsApp Aktif</label>
<input class="w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-sm bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:outline-hidden focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/40" id="clientWhatsappInput" placeholder="0812xxxxxxxx" required="" type="tel"/>
</div>
<div class="space-y-1">
<label class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface font-semibold" for="clientCityInput">Domisili Kota</label>
<input class="w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-sm bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:outline-hidden focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/40" id="clientCityInput" placeholder="Jakarta / Surabaya / Lainnya" required="" type="text"/>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Submit Button -->
<button class="w-full py-3.5 px-6 rounded-lg bg-primary-container hover:bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-lg text-label-lg font-semibold flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all" type="submit">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl">event_available</span>
            Konfirmasi Reservasi Jadwal Pertemuan
          </button>
</form>
<div class="hidden p-4 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-highest text-on-surface space-y-2" id="bookingSuccessNotice">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-semibold font-label-lg text-label-lg">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">task_alt</span>
            Permintaan Reservasi Terkirim!
          </div>
<p class="text-body-sm font-body-sm text-secondary">
            Tim asisten Denny Indra akan menghubungi via WhatsApp resmi dalam 60 menit untuk konfirmasi tautan kalender &amp; reservasi tempat.
          </p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Advisory Venue Highlight: Kota Kasablanka Office & Hospitality -->
<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 w-full mb-20">
<div class="bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl p-8 lg:p-12 overflow-hidden relative">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
<div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">domain</span>
            Meeting Suite &amp; Dedicated Facilities
          </div>
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface leading-tight">
            Kenyamanan &amp; Kerahasiaan Dialog di Jantung Bisnis Jakarta
          </h2>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Sesi konsultasi tatap muka dilaksanakan di Private Advisory Suite, Prudential Agency Office Mall Kota Kasablanka Tower Lt. 15. Dilengkapi ruang kedap suara, audio visual presentasi polis, barista coffee corner, serta akses parkir VIP.
          </p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
<div class="flex items-start gap-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary p-2 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-lg">security</span>
<div>
<div class="font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface">100% Confidential</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary">Data aset &amp; medis terlindungi NDA ketat.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary p-2 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-lg">local_cafe</span>
<div>
<div class="font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface">Executive Lounge</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary">Suasana santai profesional tanpa distraksi.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lg:col-span-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
<div class="space-y-4">
<img class="w-full h-48 sm:h-56 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-md" data-alt="Modern executive meeting room in a high-rise tower in Jakarta with floor to ceiling windows, sleek dark wooden conference table, comfortable leather chairs, warm architectural lighting, and subtle Prudential crimson accents." src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuA3Mf64tamX4nEIC1F_zfSXgBYAquvf1q4J4pymWKjrd09Oa8fYqJvLEFDGqqM5fAyq7p4KR3_3Fwvx8LGawRcsiozIRk7Jnb7zdEow-llvucHAPs7Linkxt4KJGEkqGB6j9POEqBBbGFMS5oRbS2THe9cOR7ipIUufq_TAHV-mGts4Bz2RrGshU0s4lDSNO1Kf5O6scwyC03AdvqnJ2cJg4jQH4TZ87ktmzkWE8hSh"/>
<div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-xs">
<div class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-bold">12+ Tahun</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary">Pengalaman portofolio finansial high-net-worth.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="space-y-4 -mt-6">
<div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-xs">
<div class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary font-bold">100% Rasio</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary">Pendampingan klaim medis &amp; kritis terselesaikan.</div>
</div>
<img class="w-full h-48 sm:h-56 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-md" data-alt="Professional private wealth advisor sitting in a high-end coffee lounge reviewing financial planning documents with a discreet client in Jakarta, warm ambient lighting, elegant business attire." src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuD3ci3Jz1jwVTP_WZJW1BCX7zCy_lnH64eP_rYNFVDVQrsa3oO5DU90qXlazIbDvtdECoCQU2NAkF6Vavk-g7vcLTQ4ndC6DgTRWMRrKYtiPEJrNauQNbAoYbpfbo319Uuq5nan32tSJvzPy81I2t-p21DjMN5hErarAFCL6fouQ_mySflJDf3eLb7KITZIt0tQQG4uVjxgZe8YBO_fINH1GUIozl8eQAGzJv_qDAOA"/>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Legal, Regulatory & Privacy Commitment Banner -->
<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 w-full mb-16">
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-6 lg:p-8 shadow-xs">
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary shrink-0">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">verified_user</span>
</div>
<div>
<div class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Jaminan Kerahasiaan Data &amp; Legalitas Resmi</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary max-w-2xl mt-0.5">
              Seluruh data finansial keluarga dienkripsi dengan standar perbankan. Denny Indra beroperasi di bawah naungan PT Prudential Life Assurance yang berizin &amp; diawasi oleh Otoritas Jasa Keuangan (OJK) serta memegang lisensi aktif Asosiasi Asuransi Jiwa Indonesia (AAJI No. Reg: 00921820).
            </p>
